#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""OMP usage reporter: provider quotas, pace forecasts, and token usage for Telegram.

Modes:
  codex-usage-check                  print the validated OMP JSON payload
  codex-usage-check --telegram       refresh the pinned usage and predictions images
  codex-usage-check --setup-telegram verify the Telegram config and pin both photos
  codex-usage-check --relay HOST     push this machine's usage bundle to HOST's relay directory

The Telegram bot token and chat come from ~/.config/claude-usage/config only;
delivery state lives in ~/.config/codex-usage/state.json, keyed by "message_id",
"pinned_message_id", "forecast_message_id", and "forecast_pinned_message_id".
Window resets post a new, notifying alert photo.
"""

